Z||000005||mrfiero||11-30-2001||11:36 PM||||The Fiero was stolen because it was the easiest one to take!   I highly doubt it was stolen and sent to a chop shop.....there just isn't that big of a demand for Fiero parts to warrant that.  It was taken by some teenagers who wanted a joyride.  With any luck it will turn up in a couple of days.<P>I had an '88 GT stolen about 6 or 7 years ago and it was found the next day.<P>As far as an '85 GT being irreplaceable......no comment.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
