Z||000016||Cheever3000||12-03-2001||05:24 PM||||Kevin returned my email asking for more info.  His Fiero has been recovered!  Here is his reply...<P>"The Police recovered it early sunday morning about 8 miles from my house...seems as though it overheated on the thieves!  Good thing I hadn't fixed that water leak yet!!  I've got a broken steering column and trunk lock, but that's about it....not sure what kind of engine damage it might have from the overheating yet, but it could be a lot worse than it is.  I got lucky on this one!"<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000017||Brandon86SE||12-04-2001||12:07 AM||||Hurray!  Good to hear it turned up so soon!  My best friend had his car stolen this summer, and it was missing for 4 weeks before it turned up.  His $3000 stereo was ripped out, and some body damage (steering column, bumper, etc.), Plus they put nearly 800km's on it, and shot his turbo.  It took nearly a month of repair work to get it back to proper condition.  I'm happy to hear that it did turn up right away, that's awesome!<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
