Z||000019||Doni Hagan||12-04-2001||01:15 AM||||Without exception, every stolen Fiero I've heard of in the past 6 years has been by some jerkoff wanting to joy ride in it. Unless you already own one, the parts are of little if any use as they don't fit anything else. I've seen a lot of "after-the-theft" stripped cars but never a stripped Fiero. Damaged, no stereo, sure...but never "down to the bone" stripped.  And I've NEVER,EVER heard of a Fiero OWNER stealing someone else's car. <P>If you get your hands on the thieves, leave just enough of them to be identified via their DNA. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/WAY2SLO_14.jpg"> ||||reg||1
